WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.471
Download CV retrieves the applicant’s file for an authorised admin.

00:00:05.521 --> 00:00:08.318
Each download is recorded in Activity.

00:00:08.368 --> 00:00:13.864
If a CV has expired or could not be stored, its status explains that here.

00:00:13.914 --> 00:00:19.034
Move this sample application to In review, then record the next step.
